WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:04.221
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:04.222 --> 00:00:06.408
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.409 --> 00:00:09.244
They see a gym.

4
00:00:09.245 --> 00:00:20.073
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:20.074 --> 00:00:41.230
They try stretching.

6
00:00:41.231 --> 00:01:00.074
They try yoga.

7
00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:13.719
They try walking.

8
00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:32.097
They try running.

9
00:01:32.098 --> 00:01:44.203
They try pull-ups.

10
00:01:44.204 --> 00:02:04.193
They try climbing.

11
00:02:04.194 --> 00:02:08.782
Whew! The blobs did lots of exercise.

12
00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:20.215
They get some towels.

13
00:02:20.216 --> 00:02:23.164
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:23.165 --> 00:02:26.931
Good-bye!

